`.cursor/commands/opsx-*.md` are stubs — do not duplicate steps there.

## Artifacts output

Agents MUST end responses with `## Artifacts` when they create/update/move files under `openspec/changes/`. See [`skills/openspec-artifacts-output.md`](../skills/openspec-artifacts-output.md).

## Archiving

After merge: move `openspec/changes/<name>/` to `openspec/changes/archive/YYYY-MM-DD-<name>/` (or `/opsx:archive`). Promote durable behavior into `openspec/specs/` when it should outlive the change folder.
